{"id":"pa_te_","lemma":"pâté","pos":"noun","rank":4822,"glosses":["pâté (a type of liver paste)"],"ipa":"/pa.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/aa/Fr-p%C3%A2t%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-p%C3%A2t%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pâtés"},"formAudio":{"pâtés":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-p%C3%A2t%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je vis à trois pâtés de maison.","en":"I live three blocks away.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"three"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"house, home"}]},{"text":"J'ai marché autour du pâté de maisons.","en":"I walked around the block.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"market"},{"g":"around, about"},{"g":"of the / some"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"house, home","l":"maison"}]},{"text":"La banque est à trois pâtés de maisons.","en":"The bank is three blocks away.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bank"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"three"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"house, home","l":"maison"}]},{"text":"J'habite à trois pâtés de maison d'ici.","en":"I'm three blocks away.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to live in, to occupy","l":"habiter"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"three"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"C'est environ à quatre pâtés de maison de chez moi.","en":"It's about four blocks from my house.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"about"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"four"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"}]}]}